@startuml
!include ../../../_theme.puml
title Rust Output Build
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Toolchain Lock" as Toolchain
rectangle "Rust Compilation" as Compile
rectangle "Kernel Linking" as Link
rectangle "Native Dependency Recording" as Deps
rectangle "Compile/Link Error State" as Fail

Toolchain --> Compile : constrains
Compile --> Link : produces objects for
Link --> Deps : records linked deps through
Compile --> Fail : reports compile error to
Link --> Fail : reports link error to
@enduml
